8 | fn narrow&lt;'s&gt;(k: Sink&lt;'static&gt;, _x: &'s str) -&gt; Sink&lt;'s&gt; { k } // rejected
  |           -- lifetime `'s` defined here                    ^ returning this value requires that `'s` must outlive `'static`

